      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im talking to you. i just spent 22 years building my firm from nothing. everything i had, everything i planned for, just... gone. the lawsuit, the bankruptcy, it's all gone. i feel like i just wasted two decades of my life for absolutely nothing. i'm just so tired of trying to fix things that are clearly dead.",
