      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your business was deeply linked to your identity, and its collapse is deeply affecting you on a personal level. It's as if the experience has stripped away the person you thought you were, leaving a void that feels impossible to fill. It's natural to question the purpose of continuing to exist if the foundation of your being is gone. In this moment, taking a step back to reevaluate and rediscover who you are outside of your business may be necessary.",
